1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,000
During Godot development, the agent inspects the game—and improves how it inspects it.

2
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:17,000
Overexposure and thin fonts reveal that plausible settings do not prove correct engine behavior.

3
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:32,000
The system improves luminance analysis, audits font metadata, and builds an engine-verification skill.

4
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:42,000
On the same screenshot, median analysis time falls by 30.1% across three runs, with matching metrics.

5
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:49,000
Clipped highlights obscure scene detail; the original workflow lacks comparable measurements.

6
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:56,000
Lighting changes separate road, vegetation and water. The new tool checks actual later frames.

7
00:00:56,000 --> 00:01:12,000
The font skill is reused on a world label, verifying that weight 650 changes the actual engine font.

8
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:20,000
The result is a playable r7 prototype and reusable diagnostics. The full game milestone is unfinished.
